<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ reports NZ$195.6 mln trade deficit in Oct.</title>
<headline>NZ reports NZ$195.6 mln trade deficit in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Monday released the following provisional statistics for New Zealand external merchandise trade for October.</p>
<p>(Figures are rounded)</p>
<p>Monthly series:</p>
<p>		Oct 1996	    Sept 1996	    Oct 1995</p>
<p>Balance    -$195.6 mln	 -$281.7 mln	  -$239.6 mln</p>
<p>Exports     $1.71 bln	   $1.55 bln	    $1.66 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.90 bln	   $1.83 bln	    $1.90 bln</p>
<p>		Yr-to-Oct 1996    Yr-to-Sept 1996    Yr-to-Oct 1995</p>
<p>Balance    -$623.7 mln	 -$667.7 mln	  -$428.3 mln</p>
<p>Exports     $20.95 bln	  $20.87 bln	   $21.08 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $21.57 bln	  $21.57 bln	   $21.51 bln</p>
<p>Trend series:</p>
<p>		Oct 1996	    Sept 1996	    Oct 1995</p>
<p>Balance    -$19.8 mln	  -$17.1 mln	   -$31.9 mln</p>
<p>Exports     $1.76 bln	   $1.77 bln	    $1.75 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.78 bln	   $1.78 bln	    $1.78 bln</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
